0.0.5 (145) build is live!\nJust hop into the Beta Channel via App Settings or the Store page(no secret handshake required \ud83d\ude09)\n\nAdded:\n\u2022\t\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Ultra-Clear HD 8K Street View(Beta) in Navigation Mode\n       \u2022\tNot perfect, still polishing, but definitely worth a try:)\n\u2022\t\ud83d\udd0d Search feature now auto-completes and suggests place names\n\u2022\t\ud83c\udf10 Map type selection: Satellite & Terrain layers\n        \u2022\t\u23f3 Updated loading status indicators UI\n        \u2022\t\ud83c\udfa8 Increased UI background opacity (search bar, buttons, etc.)\n\u2022\t\ud83d\udcac Invite buttons in the Help window for Discord & Beta Channel\n\u2022\t\ud83c\udf00 Snap Turn\n\u2022\t\u26a0\ufe0f Network instability waiting hints\n\nImproved & Fixed:\n\u2022\t\ud83c\udf0d Map toggle button no longer dims incorrectly\n\u2022\t\ud83c\udfa8 Fixed \"Custom Revi & Map Skin\" popup\ud83c\udf85\ud83c\udffb\n\u2022\t\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f Map switch gray background replaced with a default loading image for a smoother transition\n\nThanks for all your support as we kick off the new year together! \ud83d\ude80 More updates WIP!\n- Revi Team\u2764\ufe0f", "created_date": 1768447818, "id": "26459491833652777", "version": "0.0.5", "version_code": 145, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24837566725845304", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26641837605418198"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1768364309, "id": "26450578281210799", "version": "0.0.5", "version_code": 144, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED